{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2012-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1325376000, "end_date": 1325980799, "month_true_total": 61, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:45:25 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "1052427", "author": {"steamid": "76561197985387720", "personaname": "Ben H2O", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Ben_H2O/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1454, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 900, "last_played": 1656125943, "avatar": "637a0275cbba0d2260326cbaf894b878680381d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun game, 1 part shooter + 1 part hack and slash. Single player is fun with a good ending, lasted roughly 10 hours. Multiplayer is fun though it favors players who have played longer with more perks. The current $50 is too much unless you get really into the multiplayer, but if it goes on sale, it's probably worth it.", "timestamp_created": 1325916586, "timestamp_updated": 1325916586, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "479787", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970955432", "personaname": "Blormdorp", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970955432/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 3707, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3614, "last_played": 1594721994, "avatar": "9de324b2f3b038205c99f91e5f775e658e9b96b8"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game surprisingly had very few short falls, with Games Workshop's hit and miss record I wasn't expecting anything spectacular. But oh how I was worng, the campaign is hard, fast and keeps you genuinely enthused. With devastating ranged weapons and brutal close combat you can choose however you want to play this game. Multiplayer also equals the campaign with its hard and fast game style with unlockable and leveling features it almost feels like its own little rpg. Recommend this game to anyone who enjoys and good action game.", "timestamp_created": 1325890970, "timestamp_updated": 1325890970, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "4042635", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031203442", "personaname": "Savvy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/savor_savvy/", "num_games_owned": 985, "num_reviews": 66, "playtime_forever": 45, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 21, "last_played": 1693125512, "avatar": "02e783ab1a4ff914833d9c8c54da19a07641470f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Don't miss this game!!", "timestamp_created": 1325889828, "timestamp_updated": 1325889828, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "816346", "author": {"steamid": "76561197979234595", "personaname": "Herr Kruelbar®", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197979234595/", "num_games_owned": 124, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 10272, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7793, "last_played": 1700845581, "avatar": "d5c8886a7e6c96a04a1947b600a28022903a349c"}, "language": "english", "review": "A most awesome game - EXTREME viole